      }
    ],
    "https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#scope": [
      {
        "@value": "Institution capability-derived planning route, not an extracted experimental recipe. Preparation, growth and recovery order is curator abstraction; optional characterization branches are inferred from companion facility capabilities. Nanostructure composition/dimensions, conditions, yield and properties require separate methods evidence. Hardware maxima are not setpoints. Select individual source/dopant/substrate options below; the listed cells are not a simultaneous mixture recipe."
      }
