      {
        "@value": "Precursor preparation and material handling are source-specific research descriptions, not a general SOP. Carrier phase and precursor solvents are distinct roles; no implicit recipe transfer to other P classes. Photon counters and spectrometers are inline characterization; do not present them as synthesis hardware. No maker star, photo, price or exact neMESYS subtype verified in this research task. M-class placement is curator interpretation; no unnamed commercial model is validated."
      }
    ],
    "https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#sourceLocator": [
