        "@value": "Source reports this apparatus type in its manufacturing or characterization workflow. A segmented-flow platform produces cesium lead halide nanocrystals while recording fluorescence. CETONI neMESYS syringe pumps feed precursor and carrier streams to a PEEK cross. Droplets travel through heated coiled tubing, then an optical flow cell. Custom LabVIEW software sequences conditions and acquires data."
      }
    ],
    "https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#relation": [
      {
        "@value": "supports_claim"
      }
    ],
    "https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#reviewStatus": [
      {
        "@value": "claim_checked"
      }
    ],
    "https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#scope": [
      {
        "@value": "Precursor preparation and material handling are source-specific research descriptions, not a general SOP. Carrier phase and precursor solvents are distinct roles; no implicit recipe transfer to other P classes. Photon counters and spectrometers are inline characterization; do not present them as synthesis hardware. No maker star, photo, price or exact neMESYS subtype verified in this research task. M-class placement is curator interpretation; no unnamed commercial model is validated."
      }
    ],
    "https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#sourceLocator": [
      {
        "@value": "Experimental Section / Preparation of Precursors, journalp29/PDFp3; Microfluidic Platform and Experimental Procedure, journalp29/PDFp3; In Situ PL Measurements / reactor automation, journalp30/PDFp4"
      }
    ]
  },
