      {
        "@value": "Source reports this apparatus type in its manufacturing or characterization workflow. Atomized salt precursors become refractory-metal oxide nanoparticles, which are charged, mobility-selected and collected. TSI9302 atomizer,3077 charge neutralizer and3085 DMA are explicitly named. Reduction produces metal catalysts for substrate CVD or floating-catalyst CVD SWCNT growth. TSI3756 condensation particle counter measures aerosol concentrations. Unnamed furnace and collection assemblies must remain class-level."
      }
    ],
