    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@value": "Source reports this apparatus type in its manufacturing or characterization workflow. An automated semibatch platform dispenses reagents with Tri-Continent C3000 syringe pumps and measures products with an Ocean Optics Flame spectrometer. A custom15-vial Geneva-wheel platform evolves gold nanospheres and nanorods, then uses optimized rods as seeds for octahedral gold nanoparticles. The exact Flame detector/grating configuration is unspecified."
      }
