    "https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#associationBasis": [
      {
        "@value": "Reviewed methods of 10.1016/j.wear.2019.202944. Accepted-manuscript methods inspected. Nanoscale relevance is precursor carbon coating; final TiC is submicron. Hop 2 via the directly cited 2024 review. Curator-added M82–M88 planning alternatives are distinguished from the article-reported apparatus; exact-model compatibility is not established."
      }
    ]
