      {
        "@value": "Reviewed methods of 10.1038/s41377-018-0060-7. Reported gold nanostructures are 40 nm thick. Electron-beam evaporation is distinct from sputtering and pulsed-laser deposition. Curator-added M82–M88 planning alternatives are distinguished from the article-reported apparatus; exact-model compatibility is not established. EVG 2026-10-18 links and explicitly noted step alternatives are curator functional associations, not source-apparatus or validated recipe claims."
