        "@value": "{\"required_branches\":[[]],\"optional_category_ids\":[\"M90\"],\"unresolved_required_equipment\":false,\"readiness_review_required\":true,\"notes\":\"Curator-added optional stage, not source-paper apparatus. Optional grid vitrification before TEM verification of hydrated dispersions. Selecting this class requires a cryo-TEM configuration in the M39 verification slot. Not bulk freezing or freeze drying. Optional grid vitrification before TEM verification of hydrated dispersions. Selecting this class requires a cryo-TEM configuration in the M39 verification slot. Not bulk freezing or freeze drying.\"}"
