        "@value": "{\"required_branches\":[[\"M85\"]],\"optional_category_ids\":[\"M46\",\"M18\"],\"unresolved_required_equipment\":false,\"readiness_review_required\":true,\"notes\":\"Curator functional review 2026-10-17. Functional correction: M85 performs substrate rinsing; M46 is optional purified-water supply, not the rinse fixture. M18 remains optional drying. Review substrate holder, coating/chemistry compatibility, plumbing and exhaust; no exact model is asserted by the supplied source.\",\"allowed_subtypes_by_category\":{\"M85\":[\"wafer_wet_processing\"]}}"
      }
    ],
