        "@value": "{\"required_branches\":[[]],\"optional_category_ids\":[\"M83\"],\"unresolved_required_equipment\":false,\"readiness_review_required\":true,\"notes\":\"Magnetic separation/washing belongs to an optional characterization-preparation branch; do not make it globally required for production. It has no current category and must be reviewed if chosen. Curator implementation 2026-10-17: M83 is a optional implementation candidate; the manual/source branch remains available. P33 step 4 is an optional characterization-preparation branch, not a universal production requirement. Representative magnetic-bead racks are not validated for the cited magnetite formulation. These model alternatives are not asserted to have been used by the article authors.\"}"
