    "https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#requirementsJSON": [
      {
        "@value": "{\"required_branches\":[[]],\"optional_category_ids\":[\"M94\",\"M98\",\"M99\"],\"unresolved_required_equipment\":false,\"readiness_review_required\":true,\"notes\":\"Curator-added optional stage, not source-paper apparatus. Optional mechanical response of suitably prepared nanostructured bulk/composite surfaces; indentation depth, substrate and polishing effects require review. Optional bulk metal composition screening with suitable elemental range/calibration. Does not measure carbon content on TRACER III or nanoparticle size. Optional 3D inspection of resolvable pores/cracks in bulk nanostructured parts. Voxel size is not spatial resolution; individual nanoparticles may be unresolved. Optional mechanical response of suitably prepared nanostructured bulk/composite surfaces; indentation depth, substrate and polishing effects require review. Optional bulk metal composition screening with suitable elemental range/calibration. Does not measure carbon content on TRACER III or nanoparticle size. Optional 3D inspection of resolvable pores/cracks in bulk nanostructured parts. Voxel size is not spatial resolution; individual nanoparticles may be unresolved.\"}"
