      {
        "@value": "{\"required_branches\": [[\"M100\"]], \"optional_category_ids\": [], \"allowed_subtypes_by_category\": {\"M100\": [\"pa_nitride_mbe\"]}, \"unresolved_required_equipment\": false, \"readiness_review_required\": true, \"notes\": \"Institution capability-derived planning route, not an extracted experimental recipe. Preparation, growth and recovery order is curator abstraction; optional characterization branches are inferred from companion facility capabilities. Nanostructure composition/dimensions, conditions, yield and properties require separate methods evidence. Hardware maxima are not setpoints. Review substrate, source/plasma/cracker configuration and operating conditions before declaring the equipment plan reviewed.\"}"
